      "id": 4,
      "claim": "Randomized or well‑controlled longitudinal experiments that isolate sport mastery as the causal factor for academic improvement are scarce and their results are mixed or null.",
      "evidence": "Large‑scale RCTs targeting sport mastery are lacking; the longest longitudinal trial (Donnelly et al., 2016, 3‑year follow‑up) found no significant difference in math scores between a mastery‑focused sport program and a control group.",
